    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "yes  \nThe probability of losing no more than 1/3 means at most one investment fails.  \nP(at most one worthless) = P(0) + P(1) = (0.8)³ + 3×(0.2)×(0.8)² ≈ 0.512 + 0.384 = 0.896 ≈ 90%.  \n\\boxed{A}",
      "success": true,
