      "generated_answer": "Each investment has a 20% chance of becoming worthless, so the probability it survives is 80%. Simone loses no more than 1/3 of her investment if at most one investment fails (since 2 failures = 2/3 loss). The probability of 0 or 1 failure is: P(0) = (0.8)^3 = 0.512, P(1) = 3 × (0.2) × (0.8)^2 = 0.384; total ≈ 0.896 ≈ 90%.  \nThus, the correct answer is $\\boxed{\\text{A}}$.",
