      "generated_answer": "The wormhole appeared near Saturn 48 years before the events of the story, when Cooper and Murphy discovered the gravitational coordinates leading to NASA. This places its appearance around 48 years prior to the mission’s launch, in the year 1967 (assuming the main events occur in 2015). The wormhole’s sudden emergence set in motion the search for new habitable worlds.  \n\\boxed{48\\ years\\ before\\ the\\ mission\\ launched}",
