 for military service?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Salvatore, also known as Toto, has to leave town for compulsory military service. After falling in love with Elena and being separated from her due to her father’s disapproval, his departure for military service leads to the loss of contact with her. This experience, combined with Alfredo’s advice, ultimately pushes him to leave Giancaldo permanently to pursue his dream of becoming a filmmaker.  \n\\boxed{Salvatore}",
