      "generated_answer": "Marcus Schouler informs City Hall that McTeague lacks a dental license, seeking revenge for losing Trina and feeling cheated. This act leads to McTeague being debarred from practicing dentistry, triggering the couple’s downward spiral. Marcus’s betrayal is a pivotal moment that seals McTeague’s fate.\n\n\\boxed{Marcus Schouler}",
