{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Dickson McCunn decides to break into a home, choosing to enter via the veranda instead of the coal hole after realizing the latter feels more “burglarious.” This decision reflects his social conditioning and internal conflict between legal restraint and moral action. His shift from timidity to resolve marks a key moment in his character development.  \n\\boxed{{Dickson McCunn}}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 831,
        "output_tokens": 76,
        "total_tokens": 907
      },
      "provider": "deepinfra",
