      "generated_answer": "Epicurus calls upon the atomism of Democritus to support his view that the universe is composed of eternal, indivisible particles governed by natural laws. This framework allows him to reject divine intervention and explain natural phenomena without appealing to gods. Thus, Democritus’ atomic theory is foundational to Epicurus’ philosophical project.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Democritus}}",
