ar to make amends with the two and give them their blessing.\n\nQuestion: Why does Nick and his family move to a trailer park?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Nick and his family move to a trailer park in Clearlake because Jerry, Estelle’s boyfriend, owes money to a group of sailors and seeks to avoid confrontation by relocating. The move also brings Nick into proximity with Sheeni Saunders, with whom he forms a romantic connection. This relocation is a direct consequence of Jerry’s financial troubles and desire to escape his debts. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Jerry owes money to sailors and takes the family to a trailer park to avoid them.}}",
