    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\"In pace requiescat\" is a Latin phrase meaning \"Rest in peace.\" It is traditionally used as a prayer or inscription for the deceased, expressing the hope that they may find eternal peace. Though not explicitly stated in the provided text, it is commonly associated with the ending of *The Cask of Amontillado*, where it underscores the finality of Fortunato’s fate.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Rest in peace}}",
