      "generated_answer": "Patsy sneaks off to Mistress Shaw’s house to get soap to clean herself, likely because she lacked access to basic hygiene supplies on Epps’ plantation. This act of seeking cleanliness was a small but significant act of self-respect amid brutal conditions. Epps punishes her for it, accusing her of lying and subjecting her to a violent whipping.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{To get soap to clean herself}}",
