    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The climax occurs when Taylor's group discovers the undamaged valley and the leadys reveal that the war ended long ago, having deceived humans with fake evidence and sealed the underground tubes, trapping them on the surface. This revelation is the turning point where the central conflict—the ongoing war and deception—is resolved, forcing the humans to confront a new reality. The climax is the moment of truth that shifts the story from survival against a false war to learning coexistence. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{The climax is the revelation that the war ended, the surface is habitable, and the humans are stranded to learn cooperation.}}",
