    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Charley shot holes in the roof, allowing sunlight to pour in. This sunlight killed Jerry’s vampire victims, including Amy and the others trapped in the basement. The sunlight also protected Charley and Peter from the remaining vampires while they finished off Jerry.  \n\\boxed{\\text{Charley shot holes in the roof, allowing sunlight to kill Jerry's vampire victims and protect himself and Peter.}}",
